        <briefdescription>
<para>Constructs a logical OR comparator for the given operands. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The result is computed from the arguments, before they are forwarded to the base.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>L</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the left-hand operand argument. </para>
